univ \\ A).card)\n                    (Finset.univ \\ A).card ≤\n              RiffleUpperV2.conditionalProbability (RiffleUpperV2.fixedCountPMF cuts)\n                (RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.historyFiber cuts p RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.Direction.forward (↑j + 1) ω)\n                (RiffleUpperV2.Reservoir.pileBase cuts p e A a)"}
