                RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.RetainedAtPile hk N (RiffleUpperV2.Hypergeometric.tailCuts cuts)\n                                hn (fun (a : Fin k) => RiffleUpperV2.Hypergeometric.anchorRows c a) C chi delta\n                                hchiK) =>\n                          (↑t.snd).2.2)\n                        t))\n                  s -\n            2 *\n              RiffleUpperV2.empiricalB N a₀ cuts hn 2\n                (a₀ + 1 +\n                  ↑((fun\n                            (t :\n                              RiffleUpperV2.FirstMoment.RetainedAtPile hk N (RiffleUpperV2.Hypergeometric.tailCuts cuts)\n                                hn (fun (a : Fin k) => RiffleUpperV2.Hypergeometric.anchorRows c a) C chi delta\n                                hchiK) =>\n                          (↑t.snd).2.2)\n                        s).fst)\n                (a₀ + (d + 1)) ≤\n          -2 * eta + 4 * delta"}
