inement cuts p\n                                                                (↑j + 1) (Finset.map f Finset.univ) z =\n                                                              RiffleUpperV2.Reservoir.backwardMarkedRefinement cuts p\n                                                                (↑j + 1) (Finset.map f Finset.univ) ω₀) ≤\n                                                          2 ^ m *\n                                                              RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.tailMass cuts E v ^\n                                                                (↑m * (1 - Real.log (1 / g) / Real.log (1 / τ))) /\n                                                            (RiffleUpperV2.Exploration.reserveMass k D g ^ m / 2)"}
